WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:48.080
Chirico was defenseless, wasn't he, Arron?

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:50.000
Only one more step and-

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.830
Stop it! I get angry just thinking about it!

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:58.170
Do you suppose Mr. Killy is always so nervous
because of our shortage of data on this world?

00:01:58.170 --> 00:01:59.040
Gurran...

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:03.880
We should correct that annoying
shortage ourselves, directly.

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:07.210
You mean go down there? To Quent?

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:09.920
Surely His Excellency wouldn't object to that.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:11.330
Not at all, Arron!

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:14.460
Excellency...

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:22.630
Select a team. But there's no need to rush.

00:02:22.630 --> 00:02:25.080
Chirico has stopped moving, after all.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.790
What do you mean, sir?

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:30.040
Chirico has entered the Quentman village.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:31.790
Somewhere around there.

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:49.750
Legacy

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.250
Dak'toh noko.

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:48.210
Ga Chirico?

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.040
I'm Chirico Cuvie, sir.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:57.290
I know it may be trouble,
but I'd like to stay here a while.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.670
Quo kravash'u.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:04:59.500
Sit.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:23.960
Just a kid.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:24.920
A kid?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:28.710
He's never seen a non-Quentian before.

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:33.750
Do I scare them?

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.330
You're safe here.

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:36.500
Thanks.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:45.710
Drink this and get some sleep.

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:54.210
Is it alcohol?

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.540
I suggest you go to sleep.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.460
That was your village chief we met, right?

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.540
Let me speak to him.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.420
That was Tedaya. He's 190 years old.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.460
What I want to ask will be simple to answer.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.580
Before that, sleep.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:11.040
I'm not tired. I can go a night or two without...

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.960
Something... in the drink?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:43.170
We'll be landing around 3 klicks
from the target area.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:47.710
Quent is known for its excellent
metal detecting radar units.

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:51.960
If they wanted to, it'd be a simple matter to find us.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.500
Why is His Excellency being so careful?

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:57.040
Why did he have us carry
our weaponry disassembled?

00:06:57.040 --> 00:07:01.040
We haven't yet seen any reaction
because they don't want to attack.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:03.290
Besides, they have no weapons, right?

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.250
Perhaps...

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:09.330
The only things Quent has to sell
are mercenaries and radar.

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.920
Do you really believe that?

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:15.790
Forget it. Just a thought...

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:19.790
We're landing.

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:26.210
I don't believe this!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:29.630
We have to climb down 1,000 meters on foot?

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:38.630
Well, this isn't an open war we're fighting.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:41.290
We must endure a few
inconveniences along the way.

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.420
Time is short.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.540
So is life.

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:53.920
Fyana!

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:16.670
What did you do?

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:22.210
What did you do to me while I was asleep?

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:26.380
Calm down. We were just examining your body.

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:28.380
To see if you were changed.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.420
If I was what?

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:33.790
Humans who've been modified by
the hand of Man are taboo here on Quent.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:35.460
You're talking about PSs!

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:37.080
Well? What did you find?

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:40.000
They'll tell you tomorrow. Now sleep.

00:10:11.130 --> 00:10:12.460
Where are we going?

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.830
The frontier.

00:10:13.830 --> 00:10:20.330
In 22 hours we'll be in a sector
5 parsecs from the Quent system.

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:24.380
It's been 72 hours since Chirico arrived on Quent.

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:28.710
He's sure to gain some data soon
and then he'll make his next move.

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:30.920
What are you planning for him?

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.750
That depends on what he finds on Quent.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.920
I follow the path he sets.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:37.330
For what purpose?

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.130
I think you know why.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:44.170
I know you told him he was a PS
and sent him to Quent to learn what that means.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.960
But there's more to it than that!

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:50.500
Quite right, except I myself don't know why I did it.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:56.040
For a long time, I've been
moved by some higher power.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:58.880
When I was a Melkian soldier.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.580
And again, as a Balarant agent.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:04.580
Everything is somehow related to Chirico.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:07.920
All of my master's concern rests with him.

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:09.460
And who is your master?

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:12.080
That's something I'd like to know myself.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:56.040
Anyone who looks like Chirico?

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:59.540
Can't make him out specifically.
It's this vapor in the air, sir.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.420
Chirico's 2 kilometers ahead of us.

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.000
Aren't they assembled yet?

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:05.540
We'll need another half a day to prepare.

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:13.580
Why are we so scared of these primitives anyway?

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:17.080
Gurran, have you caught
a case of Killy's spinelessness?

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:06.830
Chirico, nevermind the formalities.
Ask him what you want to know.

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.630
I came here to learn about myself.

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:12.670
Do you know what the term "PS" means?

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:14.670
De quata'kau quesa'gi baris'shu do na.

00:13:14.670 --> 00:13:17.330
Gari'eh krevia non'keri makeh?

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:21.000
Shako has told me of these "PSs."

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:23.250
You can speak standard Astradan?

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:28.000
120 years ago, I, too, left to be a mercenary.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:31.130
That was, of course,
before either of you were born.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.380
But it's been a long time.
My tongue isn't used to it.

00:13:34.380 --> 00:13:37.580
Well, is there some sort of link
between PSs and Quent?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:43.920
If by PS you mean "One Who is Changed"
then we do have something to say.

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:48.000
"Beware of They Who are Changed."

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.920
"Beware of those who would create them."

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.420
That's it?

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:55.880
What about me?

00:13:55.880 --> 00:14:00.420
You may be One Who was Changed.

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:03.290
How do you know?

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:06.380
The women sense it.

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:10.830
Where's your proof?

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:12.330
Calm down.

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:16.040
Shako, I don't understand anything here!

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.540
You people abandoned
your civilization 3,000 years ago.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.040
But what about the Quentian
metal detectors you make?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.250
Or the energy generators for neutrino rifles?

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:26.380
All sorts of things use the element Quentium.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.750
But I don't see a civilization
capable of producing it!

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.790
Which is the real Quent?

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:36.790
We get the Quentium here,
but we do not make it.

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.790
Perhaps, if Meji is still alive...

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:41.960
"Meji?"

00:14:58.710 --> 00:14:59.880
What's wrong?

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.080
Nothing.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.790
That's not like you. Are you afraid?

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:07.710
Those over the age of 200 go in here.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:08.960
What are they doing?

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:11.380
Noh'va... Meditation.

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:13.630
Meditation?

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:33.670
What's wrong?

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:39.210
What's that?
It looks like there's light deeper in there.

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:46.170
That's were we get the Quentium.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:48.750
It's the women's duty to go and get it.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:51.500
You've never been in there?

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:54.170
No. You don't go unless you're called to go there.

00:15:54.170 --> 00:15:56.210
Why not? Is it forbidden?

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:58.460
It's always been that way.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:04.170
Chirico, come on.

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:11.830
In here.

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:14.380
I want to ask him now.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:15.630
If he still lives.

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:36.960
The sun sets early in the valley! Hurry!

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:37.790
Yes, sir!

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:39.880
The dark may give us an advantage.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:42.460
We're only here to observe, after all.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.580
Observation which may well lead to battle.

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:55.540
"Quent entered its Golden Age 85,000 years ago."

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:00.830
"But then, 3,000 years ago...

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:05.040
...beings appeared who declared themselves
gods to Quent's people."

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:07.670
Gods? Is that what he said?

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:15.960
"All were to be reborn by these gods' hands,
so they could take control of the stars," he says.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:20.710
"The people of Quent were
horrified by these gods,

00:17:20.710 --> 00:17:24.250
and drove them away into darkness."

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:30.500
"So that such a sin would never again
be committed, Quent buried its own future."

00:17:30.500 --> 00:17:33.710
These people who claimed to
be gods, who were they?

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.540
What sort of people were they?

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:38.250
Que netsumi'ya taba ra ka?

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:45.960
Were they planning to artificially
enhance everyone on Quent?

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:50.170
Are you saying I was created by them?

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:53.880
Tell me!

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:06.000
There's not one bit of evidence.

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:08.170
Just the ramblings of a demented old man.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:09.460
These "gods"...

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:12.380
The destruction of Quent's civilization
3,000 years ago...

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.710
Isn't there some clue?

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:17.630
A tiny one would be enough.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:20.250
Like maybe a bit of Quentium...

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:20.920
Of course!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.630
There's nothing to be afraid of! Forward!

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:31.540
Shh! What's that sound?

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:40.380
It's Chirico!

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:41.710
After him!

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.500
Forget him! Follow Chirico!

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:13.670
Chirico...

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:50.540
Quentium...

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:59.040
It still works.

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:02.580
Has this thing been producing
Quentium for 3,000 years?

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:22.880
Incredible...

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:25.420
The Quentian civilization still lives!

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:28.040
You're saying this is from their civilization?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.880
It's some sort of factory...

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:33.000
No, this whole thing may have been a city, once.

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:35.330
Never mind that! For now we deal with Chirico!

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.920
Don't kill him! I want him captured alive!

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:59.000
Gurran, come around from that direction!

00:20:59.000 --> 00:20:59.750
Right!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:05.920
Stop! Stop or we'll shoot!

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:27.130
Be careful, sir!

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:31.040
Mind your own business! I can climb by myself!

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:47.710
I've never seen you up close before.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:58.670
Just sleep for a little while.

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:00.290
Although, when you wake up...

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:03.170
you may find yourself to be a different man.

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:37.040
Even as consciousness faded from me, I saw it.

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:39.790
Saw how they'd disappeared.

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:42.830
What had happened?

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:45.330
And what was going to happen to me?

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:49.040
Was I still even alive?

00:22:54.960 --> 00:22:56.380
Next Episode

00:22:57.130 --> 00:23:00.130
Dimensions warp. Rock layers shift.

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:02.830
The bowels of the planet Quent are laid open.

00:23:03.630 --> 00:23:06.500
And the brilliance of Quent's ancient
super-civilization which is briefly glimpsed

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:08.210
is enough to excite ambitions.

00:23:08.500 --> 00:23:13.290
In the darkness of the Astragius Galaxy,
an enormous heartbeat begins to sound.

00:23:13.880 --> 00:23:16.960
Who will be the one to open the forbidden door?

00:23:17.540 --> 00:23:19.670
Next time, "The Forbidden"

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:22.130
God's awakening has begun.

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:24.960
The Forbidden

00:23:20.460 --> 00:23:24.960
Next Time

00:23:43.210 --> 00:23:46.670
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.670 --> 00:23:50.210
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:56.580
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:57.080 --> 00:24:00.630
Whenever I'm alone

00:24:00.630 --> 00:24:04.040
Whenever I long for you

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:10.290
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:10.290 --> 00:24:13.790
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.790 --> 00:24:17.210
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:17.380 --> 00:24:23.710
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:24.080 --> 00:24:30.040
Brighter than any other light...
